    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont want to \"live with it\" though. living with it just means waiting for the next crash or the next time i feel like dirt. if something is actually broken, like a machine or a tool, you dont just keep using it and hoping it works... you just stop. it feels like there's no point in trying to keep going when the foundation is just gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
