      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is absolutely valid to feel that the effort feels pointless when the foundation feels gone. When things feel permanently broken, the instinct to stop is a very understandable response to overwhelming pain. If you are in a place where you feel you cannot keep going, please know that immediate support is available. Reaching out to a crisis line can provide a space to feel these intense feelings without the pressure to \"fix\" anything right away.",
